�Fifteen men on the dead man's chest -
Yo-ho-ho, and a bottle of rum.'
Life changes for Jim Hawkins the day a mysterious sailor walks into his father's inn. The sailor, Billy Bones, possesses a secret which is in hot demand. As Jim discovers when Billy Bones dies, the secret is actually a map which indicates the whereabouts of some hidden treasure... and people are willing to kill for it.
The much sought-after treasure map falls into the hands of Jim, and he embarks on an adventure to find legendary riches. Little does he know that it will be a voyage fraught with numerous and unknown dangers. On a ship full of pirates, all out for their own personal gain, Jim realizes that very few can be trusted. But will the murderous crew get what they want? Or will Jim outwit them to recover the buried treasure?
Robert Louis Stevenson's tale, full of action and adventure, has entertained readers for well over a hundred years. This graphic novel adaptation brings to life a fascinating story that can be enjoyed by young and old alike."�
�O Ares, e Penelope kai e Elle.
Treis philoi sten exoria tou sklerou ki apanthropou semera, apophasizoun mia mikre apodrase apo ten kathemerinoteta. Mia omorphe anoixiatike ekdrome, mia athoa authadeia pros osa kratoun to khamogelo tous pagomeno. To niothoun, aute tha einai e Kuriake tous! To gelio tous omos tha ginei lugmos, krauge apognoses.
Ena apisteuto atukhema tha allaxei te rope ton pragmaton. Ki ustera san ntomino tha kulesoun ta gegonota, to ena meta to allo, desmeutika, apokaluptika, sugklonistika gia olous..."�

�
Ta mele tes oikogeneias tes Eiberi Gouest mporoun na kleisoun to magazi tes Prada ste leophoro ton Elusion Pedion sto Parisi, an theloun na kanoun ta psonia tous anenokhleta. Mporoun, epises, na diataxoun eukola te ripse mias bombas, an theloun na xekinesoun polemo. Anekoun se mia paniskhure kai epikindune mustike koinonia pou onomazetai O Kuklos ton Dodeka, kai e Eiberi einai to kleidi se mia arkhaia propheteia. Kapoioi theloun na te khresimopoiesoun san pioni. Kapoioi alloi theloun na te doun nekre.
Gia na xedialunei to musterio pou apeilei te zoe tes, e Eiberi prepei na akolouthesei mia seira apo ikhne, apo ta mnemeia tou Parisiou os ta stenosokaka tes Konstantinoupoles, parea me duo agoria pou douleuoun gia ton Kuklo, ton omorpho Stelan kai ton musteriode Tzak. Kathos ta ikhne phernoun sto phos mia apisteute sunomosia pou mporei na prokalesei ton Trito Pagkosmio Polemo, e Eiberi anakaluptei oti kai ta duo agoria kruboun ta dika tous mustika. Tora tha prepei na epilexei anamesa sten eleutheria kai ten oikogeneia[?] alla kai anamesa sto agori pou mporei na te boethesei na sosei ton kosmo kai to agori pou eroteuetai.
Kruphoi erotes kai kodikes, ekrexeis kai skoteina mustika sugkrouontai s' auto to romantiko thriler, pou tha mporouse na einai enas Kodikas Da Vinci gia neous."�
�O katastrophikos seismos anagkazei te Mante kai ton Khresto, pou agapiountai apo paidia, na paroun dromous khoristous, aphou ekeinos pheugei me ton patera tou gia te Germania. Epeita apo merika khronia o Khrestos epistrephei kai oi duo neoi pantreuontai, pragmatopoiontas to oneiro tous.
E Mante omos, pou ekhei ede epibarumene psukhike ugeia, polu suntoma klonizetai sobara otan anakaluptei ta mustika pou ekeinos tes kratouse. Phoboumene tis kakes glosses sto nesi, pairnei ton Nikola, ton exakhrono gio tous, kai metakomizei sten Athena. To zeugari menei makria o enas apo ton allon gia eikosi oloklera khronia, khoris omos pote na parei diazugio.
Mekhri pou e Mante arkhizei stadiaka na khanetai sta monopatia tou mualou tes kai telika diagignosketai me proimo Altskhaimer. Tote ta panta tha anatrapoun. O Khrestos, e Mante, alla kai o Nikolas tha prepei na anakalupsoun te duname tes agapes kai osa ekeine sugkhorei..."�
�Married for a day...
Fleur Gilbert and Matt Hanover married in secret, believing their love could end their bitter family feud. They were wrong.
Six lonely years later, Fleur hardly ever dreams she'll see Matt again. But Matt has never forgotten Fleur--or forgiven her. And when he learns that their one-night marriage created a son he never knew he had, he's determined to claim back his child....
And his wife...?"�
�Apo te suggraphea tou bibliou "U.G. S' agapo", ena mageutiko muthistorema gia duo eroteumenous pou den mporoun na xephugoun apo ta paikhnidia tes moiras...
Apo ten truphere elikia e Rozi kai o Alex briskontai o enas sto pleuro tou allou. Omos pano pou arkhizoun na anakaluptoun mazi ton erota kai tis khares tes ephebeias, e moira ekhei alla skhedia gi' autous...
Tha katapherei o magikos desmos pou ekhoun metaxu tous na epibiosei sto khrono, na diaterethei dunatos kai na metatrapei se mia alethine agape;
Einai e moira aute pou kinei mekhri to telos ta nemata e mia dunate agape briskei panta diexodo;
Ena truphero, aisiodoxo kai pano ap' ola alethino muthistorema pou tha sas enthousiasei!"�
�Gia trianta pente kopeles, e Epiloge apotelei ten eukairia tes zoes tous. Ten eukairia na mpoun s' enan kosmo gemato lampera phoremata kai anektimeta kosmemata. Na zesoun s' ena palati kai na prospathesoun na kerdisoun ten kardia tou goeteutikou prigkipa Meixon.
Gia ten Amerika Singker, e pithanoteta na Epilegei einai ephialtes. Giati semainei oti tha anagkastei na aparnethei ton krupho erota tes gia ton Aspen, na aphesei to spiti tes gia na summetaskhei se ena sklero diagonismo gia ena stemma pou de thelei kai na zesei s' ena palati pou apeileitai apo epitheseis epanastaton.
Kai tote e Amerika sunanta ton prigkipa Meixon. Stadiaka arkhizei na amphisbetei ola osa skhediaze gia ton eauto tes kai na suneidetopoiei oti e zoe pou eikhe oneireutei den mporei na sugkrithei me ena mellon pou den eikhe pote phantastei."�
�Linda Wright dan putrinya Emily tak pernah membayangkan warisan paman Orville, tak hanya sebuah pondok di Blossom Creek, tetapi juga sebuah agen investasi: Agen Investasi Wright! Paman Orville ternyata seorang detektif. Ketika seorang klien datang, maka duo ibu-anak ini meutuskan untuk menjadi detektif dadakan."�
�E apokalupse tes pragmatikes tautotetas tes Mplis kanei ten parousia ton Asemoaimaton akome pio apeiletike kai epikindune. Ekei pou kapote oi Galazoaimatoi apolambanan te khlidate zoe ste Nea Uorke, einai tora anagkasmenoi na dosoun ten ustate makhe gia na epibiosoun. O erotas paizei akome semantiko rolo gia ta neara bampir. E mepos okhi; E Skailer ekhei kanei ten epiloge tes. Ekhei egkataleipsei ton Tzak gia ton Oliber, protimontas ton anthropo apo to bampir. Alla oi palies agapes argoun na pethanoun... Kai akome kai e psukhre Mimi phainetai na upopherei apo kapoious desmous pou de spane pote.
Sto tetarto biblio tes seiras ton Galazoaimaton e drase koruphonetai kai pairnei aprosmene trope."�	
�	Mia misopantremene, mia anupantre egkumonousa, enas antras se diastase, mia orime gerontokore, mia neare gerontokore, enas erotomalthakos ki enas omophulophilos pou einai pantremenos me antra kai pou ekhoun mazi ena paidi.
De tha tous paromoiaze kaneis kai me ta ephta thaumata tou kosmou!
Entaxei! Oute omos kai me ta ephta thanasima amartemata. Skhedon!
Giati... kapoies mikres amartioules oi ethelontes tes ephtadas tis kanoun!
Ethelontes; A, nai!
Entelos aprosmena kai aproetoimasta, autoi oi ephta Ellenes enonoun tis... dunameis tous kai summetekhoun se ena europaiko protzekt.
Ki ola xekinoun me enan gamo.
Pio sugkekrimena, duo deuterolepta prin apo to Amen! Ena semadiako gegonos anagkazei ten ephtada na sunanastraphei kai na emplakei se mia dakrubrekhte peripeteia.
Ta mere sta opoia oi ethelontes ekhoun tis sunanteseis tous poikilloun. Mporei na einai to nekrotomeio Athenon, to aerodromio, ena dikasterio tou... Los Antzeles, akome kai e Karditsa. A! Polles phores oi ethelontes katalegoun kai se mia aithousa pou khresimopoieitai gia sunedries "Group Therapy".
To oti tha klapsete mazi tous einai sigouro.
An omos einai apo trantakhto gelio, me niosete enokhes... se kamia periptose de tha phtaite eseis!"�
�1777, doukato tou Mpraounsbaik: gennietai o Karl Phrintrikh Gkaous, to pio diasemo paidi-thauma ton mathematikon, pou ezese pote. Skenes opos aute tou trikhronou Gkaous na diorthonei tous arithmetikous upologismous tou patera tou e ekeine tou dekakhronou Gkaous na upologizei en ripe ophthalmou sto skholeio to athroisma ton 100 proton akeraion arithmon, einai pleon klasikes kai apoteloun ton orismo tes idiophuias.
1800, Panepistemio tou Mpraounsbaik: o Gkaous se elikia 23 eton olokleronei to ergo tou skhetika me te Theoria Arithmon, te "Basilissa ton Mathematikon", opos ten apokalouse.
1801: Ena paidiko oneiro ginetai pragmatikoteta. O mikroules Karl, pou ethele na ginei kapote san ton prigkipa tou topou tou, anagnorizetai ap' akrou eis akron tes Europes os "o Prigkipas ton Mathematikon".
1855: O megalos mathematikos, o epaggelmatias astronomos, o kainotomos topographos, o epheuretikos phusikos, ligo prin aphesei ten teleutaia tou pnoe, katametra tis emeres pou eikhe zesei. Oi arithmoi kathe eidous ton goeteuan mekhri ten teleutaia stigme.
Einai ena sunarpastiko mathematiko muthistorema. Tautizetai me mia alethine autobiographia, ten opoia o Gkaous den eikhe pote ten eukairia na grapsei. Istorika tekmeriomeno, eukharisto kai prosito se olous, metadidei me monadiko tropo te goeteia ton mathematikon.
"...Me ton steno mou philo, ton Bolphgkangk Mpoliai, piname tis mpires mas sta kapeleia suzetontas ateleiotes ores gia tous protous arithmous, te geometria kai te sunarpastike Theoria Arithmon. Ten teleutaia nukhta tes phoitetikes zoes mas, upsosame ta poteria, eukhethekame na petukhoume os epistemones, antallaxame tis pipes mas kai khorisame gia panta.
...Otan ta strateumata tou Napoleonta katelaban to Mpraounsbaik, o stratiotikos dioiketes erthe sto spiti mou me mia allokote entole apo to Parisi: "Den mas endiapherei o thanatos tou Douka, bebaiotheite pos o diasemos mathematikos Gkaous einai zontanos." Molis o strategos Perneti delose oti erkhotan ek merous tes Mantmazel Sophi Zermen, emeina aphonos. Pos na to phantasto oti o gallos mathematikos Mesie Lemplank, me ton opoio allelographousa tosa khronia, den etan andras alla gunaika, kai malista eikhe
apaitesei apo ton Napoleonta ten prostasia mou!" (Apo ten parousiase tes ekdoses)"�
�<>.
O Ramiro Mpernantes epistrephei sten Argentine meta apo oktakhrone apousia gia spoudes sto Parisi. Einai kalodekhoumenos ste geneteira tou kai kata te diarkeia enos deipnou sto spiti kapoiou oikogeneiakou philou gnorizetai me te neare kai polu elkustike Araseli. E panselenos kai e zeste aporruthmizoun ton Ramiro pou epikheirei kati to opoio pote sto parelthon de tha eikhe skephtei. Biazei kai dolophonei te neare kopela... Sto mikro khroniko diastema ton trion emeron pou akolouthoun, o nearos, pherelpis doktor tes nomikes kai mellontiko stelekhos tes stratiotikes kuberneses tes khoras, metatrepetai ston up' arithmon ena upopto gia phono. Omos gia poion akribos phono ton anakrinei e asphaleia; Poios einai nekros kai poios zontanos; Einai o dolophonos sigouros gia tis praxeis tou; Poses phores arage mporei o idios anthropos na skotosei ton idio anthropo;"�
�Star rock singer George Brandon is about to open in the show "Danger Zone"-that is, if he can stay alive. Someone-or something-is out to get him. Will it be curtains before curtain time? Not if the Three Investigators can help it."�
�E Lous tha pethaine gia ton Ntaniel. Kai ekhei pethanei. Ksana kai xana. Ste diarkeia ton aionon, e Lous kai o Ntaniel xanabriskoun o enas ton allo mono kai mono gia na khoristoun kai pali. Alla, isos, de khreiazetai na einai pia etsi... E Lous einai sigoure oti kati e kapoios apo ten proegoumene zoe tes mporei na te boethesei. Ki etsi gurizei piso sto parelthon gia na einai marturas stis protes sunanteseis tes me ton Ntaniel kai sta prota erotika tous skirtemata. O Kam kai oi legeones ton aggelon kai ton Apokleron einai apophasismenoi na piasoun te Lous sta kheria tous. Oso gia ton Ntaniel, tremei ste skepse gi' auto pou prokeitai na ginei, an e Lous xanagrapsei ten istoria tous, an e aionia agape tous sbesei gia panta mesa stis phloges..."�	
�	E LAIA EINAI SKLABA. O ELIAS EINAI STRATIOTES. KANEIS DEN EINAI ELEUThEROS.
Upo to kathestos tes Stratiotikes Autokratorias, o thanatos einai e anapopheukte katalexe gia osous tolmoun na men upakousoun stous kanones. Osoi den aphieronoun to soma kai ten psukhe tous ston Autokratora kinduneuoun na steiloun sto ektelestiko apospasma tous dikous tous kai na doun katheti agapemeno na katastrephetai.
Mesa s' auton ton biaio kosmo, empneusmeno apo ten arkhaia Rome, e Laia zei me tous pappoudes tes kai me ton megalutero adelpho tes. E oikogeneia zei phtokhika, khoris na prokalei ten Autokratoria. Gnorizei kala ti sumbainei se osous to kanoun.
Otan, omos, o adelphos tes Laia sullambanetai gia prodosia, e kopela anagkazetai na parei mia apophase. Me antallagma te zoe tou, tha boethesei tous epanastates energontas os kataskopos tous ste megalutere stratiotike akademia tes Autokratorias.
Ekei tha sunantesei ton Elias, ton kalutero ekpaideuomeno tes skholes - kai, krupha, ton pio aprothumo. To mono pou thelei o Elias einai na eleutherothei apo te skleroteta kai ten turannia gia tis opoies ekpaideuetai. Oi duo neoi tha suneidetopoiesoun suntoma oti oi moires tous einai allelendetes kai oti oi epiloges tous tha allaxoun gia panta te moira tes Autokratorias."␀␀p@"	�G�z@"	��Q�@"	H�z�G@"	ffffff@"	{�G�z@"	���(\�@"	������@"	������@"	������@"	�p=
